2. Additional merged work (2026-10-19 architecture merge)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The shipped binary additionally contains a merge of:
  - streaming KV: page fault-back-in and budget-based demotion, wired into the
    KVMem ring;
  - the Bonsai 27B ternary model line (qwen3_5 execution path).
Source build root (as recorded inside the binary): a local, unpublished
`infer-build/fusion-arch-20261019` tree. This part is not a public repository.

